@startuml

' sequenceDiagram
' participant Client
' participant JobManager
' participant RestSourceEnumerator
' participant TaskManager
' participant RestSourceReader
' participant RestSplitReader

box Client Side
    ' Client
    participant Client
end box
box Cluster Coordinator
    ' JobManager
    ' RestSourceEnumerator
    participant JobManager
    participant RestSourceEnumerator
end box
box Cluster Worker
    ' TaskManager
    ' RestSourceReader
    ' RestSplitReader
    participant TaskManager
    participant RestSourceReader
    participant RestSplitReader
end box

title Flink RestSource Lifecycle

Note over Client: Phase 1: Job Submission
Client->>JobManager: env.execute(JobGraph with RestSource)

Note over JobManager, RestSourceEnumerator: Phase 2: Job Initialization (JobManager)
JobManager->>RestSourceEnumerator: createEnumerator(context)
activate RestSourceEnumerator
RestSourceEnumerator->>RestSourceEnumerator: start()
RestSourceEnumerator->>RestSourceEnumerator: createInitialSplits()
Note right of RestSourceEnumerator: Generates initial page splits
deactivate RestSourceEnumerator

Note over TaskManager, RestSourceReader: Phase 3: Task Execution (TaskManager)
JobManager->>TaskManager: Deploy Task(SourceOperator)
TaskManager->>RestSourceReader: createReader(context)
activate RestSourceReader
TaskManager->>RestSourceReader: start()
RestSourceReader->>JobManager: context.sendSplitRequest()
deactivate RestSourceReader

Note over JobManager, RestSplitReader: Phase 4: Runtime Data Flow
loop Data Processing Loop
    JobManager->>RestSourceEnumerator: handleSplitRequest()
    activate RestSourceEnumerator
    RestSourceEnumerator->>RestSourceReader: context.assignSplit(split)
    deactivate RestSourceEnumerator

    activate RestSourceReader
    RestSourceReader->>RestSplitReader: addSplits(split)
    deactivate RestSourceReader

    activate RestSplitReader
    RestSplitReader->>RestSplitReader: fetch() -> apiClient.fetchPage()
    Note right of RestSplitReader: Makes HTTP call
    RestSplitReader-->>RestSourceReader: Returns records
    deactivate RestSplitReader

    activate RestSourceReader
    loop For each record in page
        RestSourceReader->>RestSourceReader: emitRecord(record, output)
        Note right of RestSourceReader: Data sent to downstream
    end
    RestSourceReader->>RestSourceReader: onSplitFinished(splitId)
    RestSourceReader->>JobManager: context.sendSourceEventToCoordinator(PageCompletedEvent)
    deactivate RestSourceReader

    JobManager->>RestSourceEnumerator: handleSourceEvent(event)
    activate RestSourceEnumerator
    alt Unbounded and has more data
        RestSourceEnumerator->>RestSourceEnumerator: Create next page split
    else Bounded or no more data
        RestSourceEnumerator->>RestSourceReader: signalNoMoreSplits()
    end
    deactivate RestSourceEnumerator
end

Note over JobManager, RestSourceReader: (Periodic) Phase 5: Checkpointing
JobManager->>RestSourceEnumerator: snapshotState()
JobManager->>RestSourceReader: snapshotState()

Note over JobManager, RestSourceReader: Phase 6: Shutdown
JobManager->>RestSourceEnumerator: close()
JobManager->>RestSourceReader: close()

@enduml
